      "writtenOn": "2025-07-30T11:12:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s a big nitpick and I recognise it\u0027s not a priority, but there are some subtle syntactic differences from the SPDX BSD-3 license file that might make it a bit more challenging for some tools to recognise this file as BSD-3.\n\nI recommend grabbing the one from the SPDX website and just filling in the `\u003cvar\u003e` parts, leaving alone anything else: https://spdx.org/licenses/BSD-3-Clause.txt",
